{"title":"2021 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For each positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/8/d98b785104c513b77a610a6b248781c3960608ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+3+\\cdots+(n-1)+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"229\" height=\"20\" /> represents the sum of all of the integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> inclusive. What integer is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/9/61917a9356aa070421adeb56daa59149725fc4c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+2+3+\\dots+2020+2021)-(1+2+3+\\dots+2018+2019)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"517\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/b/6dbcf1c35ae387b9cae8600dad568a9300b9ba6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 \\cdots + (n - 1) + n = \\frac{n(n + 1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"305\" height=\"40\" /> for all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/f/fef59414bd45752bac7455271d5eeeb5c8112125.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+2+3+\\dots+2020+2021)-(1+2+3+\\dots+2018+2019) = \\frac{2021(2022)}{2} - \\frac{2019(2020)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"745\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/7/7a7a08f4c2d2528ad5f58c77832469f06a0b322b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=1011 \\times 2021 - 1010 \\times 2019$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"233\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/4/724ce631019ec52b46033f161913451ce653311a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=1010 \\times 2021 + 2021 - 1010 \\times 2019$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"292\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/b/24b6a3bce1c8f5473b68d779ada2b1b48f82ed56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=1010 \\times (2021 - 2019) + 2021$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"247\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/4/344bb6ba9d51fcfe8bedb0bead3e5a3620d665c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=1010 \\times 2 + 2021$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"147\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/2/89239d4ad2f3d0e94d2c9a76d8b0f9d001bd1fbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2020 + 2021$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/1/79190796a7743c89a56d17ea36a8c71a4aefde27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{4041}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"69\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/7/437bcf0036e135782bee6904efce9344aa7edfad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1 + 2 + 3 + \\cdots + (n + 2) + (n + 3)) - (1 + 2 + 3 + \\cdots + n + (n + 1))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"552\" height=\"20\" /> would be:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/4/c44e08fa36ab02b1218fdab40f7b2ec1623ffed7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1 + 2 + 3 + \\cdots + n + (n + 1) + (n + 2) + (n + 3)) - (1 + 2 + 3 + \\cdots n + (n + 1)) = n + 2 + n + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"775\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>From the problem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/6/5b6630fba62792a0543ead5559d9a9d350b08ac0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2018$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/3/233fc575befa302971e230269e0ffb88abedb284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+2+3+\\dots+2020+2021)-(1+2+3+\\dots+2018+2019) = 2020 + 2021$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"636\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/1/79190796a7743c89a56d17ea36a8c71a4aefde27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{4041}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"69\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC\">